  "2026-10-14T20:01:20.827Z",codex-agent,"Review updates merge changed fields against a validated ancestor revision. Disjoint fields converge; same-field scalar disagreements choose canonical minimum and persist both values, rule and authenticated principal in a native outcome record. Proposal revision resets review to pending; stale prior-version updates fail closed."
  "2026-10-14T20:05:27.194Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof: changed only the mergeServedReview merge call from field mediation against current+proposed to mergeRecords(base, base, proposed, REVIEW_MERGE_POLICY), reproducing whole-record overwrite. Rebuilt dist and ran node --test --test-name-pattern='concurrent reviewers' test/served-forge.test.ts. Exit 1: reviewer was lost and approved status reverted to pending. Restored field merge and rebuilt. The new function has no origin/main implementation; this is a targeted behavioral rollback rather than an unrelated failure."
  "2026-10-14T20:09:09.506Z",codex-agent,"Repository-pinned pm test pm-vcs-6e5m --run --progress passed 1/1; exit 0, zero failures/skips/cancellations/todos. The existing project disables persistent test-result tracking; this comment retains the verified receipt without changing policy."
